{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cd19da653011ffed5358b98f51518f8e405e2d59fc17cf470ebf15a3bad5bd80", "ja": "（紬たちが出演する、新しく始まる配信番組用の\nPV撮影が終わった。あとは、配信本番を残すのみだ）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b", "ja": "ふぅ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2678653ba3758cc37eda1d8e0d4f35d3c8231ae6fef71079b82b901785726c26", "ja": "お疲れさま、紬。いつもどおりに見えたけど……\nやっぱり、すごく緊張してたんだな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "02515cb9e0c0413062cc3e37535a9b9dc8bfddb331bf72ca62c340d7e4db47b3", "ja": "……あなたの目は節穴なのですか？\nいつもどおりであれば、緊張していて当然です。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1004_p", "source_sha256": "be97d1041df3b3650f390f2326b4ab0cc4a7b0ffff35a1fdbc76b64e8f98809d", "ja": "あっ、ごめん。ええと、\nいつも以上にというか……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ea2d6d8c9ed9aedfcc0752f9adba25a3f540ab84ff0abe9011b205d1733cf680", "ja": "当然でしょう。今回、このような戦いに\n挑むことになったのは、私の責任なのですから。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "34ac3f9bc46cafeed3cbec057caff2aff11aa6faa1908ff4ec521d83f0ad22f1", "ja": "その私が、無様な姿を見せることになったら、\n自分で自分を許せません。それに……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b623315d6f68d20cbe10bbab3d0979a5f466defddf1beb47178709920397f225", "ja": "配信とは違い、PV撮影は何度も経験があります。\nいつもどおりで満足していてはだめなのです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1008_p", "source_sha256": "804f51a1366438241a02659dde5c59fcb36d6a206a13934acafc254e7a11416a", "ja": "そうか。でも、配信も杏奈たちと一緒に練習\nしてるんだろ？　聞いたよ、うまくなってきたって。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "30cf132b37d037ceef706f78767b26f131b8b593e892b0d6852df2d51ba76fe1", "ja": "そ、それは……きっと望月さんが、気を遣って\n言ってくださっているだけです……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a895af2aab3fee377e9a08bb8d72073b82f7fba41a769a7dd8fca1dfe6e24001", "ja": "自分が一番よくわかっています。望月さんにも、\n今回のライバル方にも遠く及ばないと……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1011_p", "source_sha256": "219738e3cffceef8e148947a30b398af447de77421db67e124ae22661b4d8deb", "ja": "確かに技術面ではそうかもしれないけど、\n紬の配信も可愛くて面白かったと思うよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2887533aba9e6a5869e84cf11304a91fa41ff2fb99d0c78bbcdfdd34697a6a1e", "ja": "なっ……いつ！？　いつ見たのですか！？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f263a4473e1373c6825d9043e0e75cd7a0667429c65157d5678b6589d4ecca1b", "ja": "いつって、この間の……杏奈とふたりで配信練習\nしていたときのやつだよ。一緒に雑談してた……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "feec5110dab2038b9664692279ce5c44098ea5387a3ffd217d7f16bd05dd1388", "ja": "そ、そのようなことを面と向かって……あなたの\n辞書に、デリカシーという言葉はないのですか！？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0d1d7bfec0afc85d735b818fcb0cfaae664a34ccc1e80946abc20165f4b070e0", "ja": "ううっ……。がんこ恥ずかしいげん……。\nでも……はあ……。お礼は言わないといけませんね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0613_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5fbdb42e671dc281d5463b198539eb9a7fc4bb2987cdc95731d8640b6774f817", "ja": "……ありがとうございます。少し自信がつきました。\n配信本番も、胸を張ってやり通して見せます。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
